@startuml
!include _style.puml
title SellerApplication State: Actual Review Guards
hide empty description
[*] --> PENDING : customer submits new application\n[not already seller; no PENDING/APPROVED application]
PENDING --> APPROVED : approveApplication()\n[no existing seller]
PENDING --> REJECTED : rejectApplication(reason)
PENDING --> NEED_MORE_DOC : requestMoreDocuments(message)
REJECTED --> APPROVED : approveApplication()\n[no existing seller]
NEED_MORE_DOC --> APPROVED : approveApplication()\n[no existing seller]
REJECTED --> NEED_MORE_DOC : requestMoreDocuments(message)
NEED_MORE_DOC --> REJECTED : rejectApplication(reason)
APPROVED --> REJECTED : rejectApplication(reason)\n[no source-status guard]
APPROVED --> NEED_MORE_DOC : requestMoreDocuments(message)\n[no source-status guard]
REJECTED --> REJECTED : repeat reject / replace note and review metadata
NEED_MORE_DOC --> NEED_MORE_DOC : repeat request-docs / replace note and review metadata

note right of APPROVED
Approval saves reviewedBy/reviewedAt, changes User.role to SELLER,
and creates ACTIVE Seller plus SellerBankAccount.
Already APPROVED or existing seller blocks approval.
Later rejection/document request does not remove that Seller
or revert the User role.
Admin authorization is enforced outside the service by the filter.
end note
note left of NEED_MORE_DOC
No in-place edit/resubmit endpoint exists.
After NEED_MORE_DOC or REJECTED, an eligible customer
can submit a NEW PENDING application (different entity).
All review actions save a review timestamp and reviewer;
rejection/document requests also save adminNote.
end note
' Sources: backend/src/main/java/project/project/Entity/seller/SellerApplicationStatus.java
' Sources: backend/src/main/java/project/project/Service/implement/SellerApplicationServiceImp.java
' Sources: backend/src/main/java/project/project/Controller/SellerApplicationController.java; Filter/SellerApplicationAdminFilter.java
@enduml
